{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26578","headline":"送任畹评事赴沂海 · 姚合","name":"送任畹评事赴沂海","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"掷笔不作尉，戎衣从嫖姚。\n严冬入都门，仆马气益豪。\n沂州右镇雄，士勇旌旗高。\n洛东无忧虞，半夜开虎牢。\n丈夫贵功勳，不贵爵禄饶。\n仰眠作书生，衣食何由销。\n任生非常才，临事胆不摇。\n必当展长画，逆波斩鲸鳌。\n九陌尘土黑，话别立远郊。\n孟坚勒燕然，岂独在汉朝。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"姚合","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_26578.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_26578","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}